        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'aba Moabu n'aba Seiri okugira bati: Reeba, enju ya Yuda eri nk'agandi mahanga goona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikyo ndiihiraho omwatano gw'ensi ya Moabu, okuruga aha ndembo zaagwo okuhika Besi-yeshimoosi, Baali-meoni na Kiryasaimu, ezirihaisa egyo nsi ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
