        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabwa Edomu kukora kubi enju ya Yuda nibabahoora, kandi omu kuhoora kwabo bakacumura munonga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
