        {
          "text": " Ndyahooresa Edomu abantu bangye Israeli, bakore omuri Edomu nk'oku ndikwenda nibahikiiriza ekiniga kyangye n'okuguubwa kubi kwangye. Kandi baryamanya okuhoora enzigu kwangye; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.",
